1. `fix/bootstrap-syntax-lock`
2. `fix/hermetic-tests-worktree`
3. `ci/remove-false-green`
4. `fix/observer-truth-boundary`
5. `ci/observer-react-required`
6. `governance/authority-config-v3`
7. `feat/adapter-manifests-roundtrip`
8. `governance/provenance-rights`
9. `docs/evidence-current-handoff`

不要把 EOL renormalize、依赖锁、Observer、Authority 和历史标记混在一个提交。

